  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent, about 3 minutes.",
    "Stir in the cumin, smoked paprika, turmeric, and coriander powders and sauté for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Pour in the coconut milk and bring to a gentle simmer.",
    "Add the frozen peas and diced carrots, then stir in the peanut butter and lemon juice.",
    "Simmer the curry for 15 minutes, stirring occasionally, until the peas are tender and the sauce thickens.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the curry hot, garnished with chopped cilantro and a side of warm flatbread."
  ],
